==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|fro|baignier}}, from {{inh|fr|VL.||*baneare}}, {{inh|fr|LL.|balneāre}}, from {{inh|fr|la|balneum}}, and probably later influenced by the related French {{m|fr|bain}}. Compare {{cog|oc|banhar}}, {{cog|ca|banyar}}, {{cog|it|bagnare}}, {{cog|es|bañar}}, {{cog|pt|banhar}}.

